<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνευμᾰτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn into vapour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				965b39
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				962a8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become wind, evaporate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				305b14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				737a11
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be filled with wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2pp.44,47
			</span></i> U. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>effervesce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.569
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				661
			</span></i>; <i>ferment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.549
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>cause flatulence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>blow up, inflate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxipp.
				1.47
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκὸς πεπνευματωμένος</span>
				Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.13A.
			</span></i>; esp. <i>to be flatulent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UP</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be filled with the breath of life, PMag.Leid.
				W.</i><i><span class="en">
				12.32
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
